,{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment26","raw_text":"炮击三兵会减弱中防能力，不若改走马7进5固守。","text":"炮击三兵会减弱中防能力，不若改走马7进5固守。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"0:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":" 黑放弃中卒过早，由左翼迂回牵制红方中攻力量的目的很难达到，可改走车8进3","text":" 黑放弃中卒过早，由左翼迂回牵制红方中攻力量的目的很难达到，可改走车8进3","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"黑方飞左象是最大的失误，造成红有车六进四塞象眼，炮打中象的严厉手段，应改走马7进5，虽居下风，尚可维持.|| 此时形势，黑方中路及右翼均较薄弱。红方抓住了战机。逐步进遥，一鼓而下。","text":"黑方飞左象是最大的失误，造成红有车六进四塞象眼，炮打中象的严厉手段，应改走马7进5，虽居下风，尚可维持.\n 此时形势，黑方中路及右翼均较薄弱。红方抓住了战机。逐步进遥，一鼓而下。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":" 黑方防守无策，现进左车旨在一搏，如改走车8进3t则车八进七，车1平3，车六进四，黑亦难下。","text":" 黑方防守无策，现进左车旨在一搏，如改走车8进3t则车八进七，车1平3，车六进四，黑亦难下。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"红伸车象眼，凶着，击中黑方要害，以下进入杀王阶段。黑炮9平5打马，不过是聊尽人事的着法，因此时已无好着解围了。","text":"红伸车象眼，凶着，击中黑方要害，以下进入杀王阶段。黑炮9平5打马，不过是聊尽人事的着法，因此时已无好着解围了。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment43:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment43","raw_text":"（红胜）||红退炮老练，下一着车七平六即成绝杀。","text":"（红胜）\n红退炮老练，下一着车七平六即成绝杀。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":43,"anchor_node_id":"0:43","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["江苏周顺发 先胜 上海胡荣华"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C17 中炮过河车对屏风马"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":18,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":43,"legal_move_records":43,"annotations":10,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":10}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第一章 中炮对屏风马类 江苏周顺发 先胜 上海胡荣华","catalogue_order":2,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/list-66.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
